      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>This appendix provides stat blocks for creatures mentioned elsewhere in the book, particularly in the class, equipment, and spell chapters. See the rules glossary for how to read a stat block, and see the <em>Monster Manual</em> for even more creatures.</p><p>The following stat blocks are presented in alphabetical order. When the Dungeon Master uses a stat block, the DM may change details in it.</p>"
